  "title": "HMH Holding Inc. Announces Closing of Initial Public Offering",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, April 02, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HMH Holding Inc. (“HMH”) (NASDAQ: HMH) today announced the closing of its initial public offering of 10,520,000 shares of its Class A common stock at $20.00 per share. The underwriters have a 30-day option to purchase up to an additional 1,578,000 shares",
